{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55216","headline":"六目龟口号（题拟） · 敬新磨","name":"六目龟口号（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不要闹，不要闹，听取龟儿口号。\n六只眼儿睡一觉，抵别人三觉。\n（见宋张世南《游宦纪闻》卷二。\n）（按：《游宦纪闻》谓此诗爲东坡谒吕微仲时述，张端义《贵耳集》卷上径作东坡代龟作，恐非。\n《东臯杂录》卷一仅作「六只眼儿分明，睡一觉抵别人三觉。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"敬新磨","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55216.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55216","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}